{"id":"zueinander","lemma":"zueinander","pos":"adv","rank":3692,"glosses":["together","to each other, to one another"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6c/De-zueinander.ogg/De-zueinander.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"In dem Zimmer passt nichts zueinander.","en":"Nothing in the room matches with anything else.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"room"},{"g":"to fit","l":"passen"},{"g":"nothing"},null]},{"text":"Habt ihr Kontakt zueinander?","en":"Are you in contact with each other?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"contact"},null]},{"text":"Haben Sie Kontakt zueinander?","en":"Are you in contact with each other?","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"contact"},null]},{"text":"Wir wollen ehrlich zueinander sein.","en":"Let's be honest with each other.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to want"},{"g":"honest, truthful, true"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Alle waren nett zueinander.","en":"Everyone was kind to each other.","words":[{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"nice"},null]}]}